<template name="config-menu__audio">
    <head>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form class="config__form">
            <div class="config__wrapper">
                <div class="config-debug">
                    <div class="config-debug__scroll">
                        <div class="config-debug-option" data-if="aud_changed">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div style="flex: 1 1 0dp; width: 100%; white-space: normal;">Changed settings apply when the game is next launched.</div>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="config-debug-option">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>Music</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Randomize Music</div><div class="config-tip-text">Towns: every area's music is drawn at random from the game's tracks, freshly on each launch. All: the same, plus everything the game starts by name rather than by area - the title screen, battles and bosses, the victory fanfare, the death jingle, the credits, saving - each swapped for a random track for the session. Custom: play your own music from the custom_music folder next to the game, chosen per track below (Randomise all fills every track from the folder). Track choices apply straight away, and Play on a row starts that track now - Stop goes back to what was playing. Off, Towns and All are drawn when the game is next launched. A file is a .seq in the game's own format; q64music.exe next to the game makes one from an .ootrs pack or a MIDI, and custom_music.txt beside the settings says what was loaded.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="aud_music" id="aud_music_select" style="nav-up: #tab_audio">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">Towns</option>
                                            <option value="2">All</option>
                                            <option value="3">Custom</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="config-debug-option">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>Sound effects</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Shuffle sound effects</div><div class="config-tip-text">Every one of the game's 70 sound effects becomes a different one, the same swap for the whole session and a new draw on each launch. Menus, footsteps, spells, hits and all. Any sound still going three seconds after it started is cut, so a looping ambience that lands on a common sound cannot run on.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="aud_sfx_shuffle" id="aud_sfx_shuffle_select">
                                            <option value="0">Off</option>
                                            <option value="1">On</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="config-debug-option" data-if="aud_music == 3">
                            <label class="config-debug-option__label">
                                <div>Tracks</div>
                            </label>
                            <div class="config-debug__option-split">
                                <div class="config-debug__option-controls">
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper" style="margin-bottom: 8dp;">
                                        <button class="button" onclick="aud_music_random_all">Randomise all</button>
                                        <button class="button" onclick="aud_music_clear_all">Clear all</button>
                                        <button class="button" onclick="aud_music_rescan">Rescan folder</button>
                                        <button class="button" onclick="aud_stop_preview">Stop</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper" data-if="aud_library_count == 0">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" style="font-size: 14dp; width: 100%;"><div>No .seq files in the custom_music folder</div></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Title screen</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 27: Title screen. Play starts it now, as set here.</div></div>
                                        <select data-value="aud_track_27" id="aud_track_27_select">
                                            <option value="0">Game's own</option>
                                            <option data-for="name, i : aud_library" data-attr-value="i + 1">{{name}}</option>
                                        </select>
                                        <button class="button aud-play" onclick="aud_play_track:27">Play</button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="config-debug__select-wrapper">
                                        <div class="config-debug__select-label" data-event-mouseover="show_tip" data-event-mouseout="hide_tip"><div>Battle</div><div class="config-tip-text">Track 13: Battle. Play starts it now, as set here.</div></div>
